title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"prop-lindenbaum-algebra-—-Lindenbaum-Algebra\">prop-lindenbaum-algebra — Lindenbaum Algebra</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> is a language candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{\\mathcal L}=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(F_{\\mathcal L}=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> is a consequence-relation candidate on it.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> is the formula algebra of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8181bcdfbad8d73a\" href=\"?note=8181bcdfbad8d73a\" title=\"93-df-valuation\">93-df-valuation</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\">\\(\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LindAlg}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\">\\(\\operatorname{LindAlg}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> have their source signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lindenbaum\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\langle\\phi,\\psi\\rangle\\in\nT_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})^2:\n\\{\\phi\\}\\vdash\\psi\\land\\{\\psi\\}\\vdash\\phi\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lindenbaum\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\langle\\phi,\\psi\\rangle\\in\nT_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})^2:\n\\{\\phi\\}\\vdash\\psi\\land\\{\\psi\\}\\vdash\\phi\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lindenbaum\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LindAlg}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L},\n\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash);\n\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lindenbaum\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LindAlg}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L},\n\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash);\n\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lindenbaum\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}\n\\bigl(T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93}),\\vdash\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{LindAlg}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\phi;\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L},\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\bigr)\n=\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\psi;\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L},\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16em}\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\phi,\\psi\\rangle\\in\n\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lindenbaum\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}\n\\bigl(T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93}),\\vdash\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{LindAlg}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\phi;\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L},\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\bigr)\n=\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\psi;\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L},\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16em}\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\phi,\\psi\\rangle\\in\n\\operatorname{Interder}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\vdash)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Interderivability must be compatible with every connective before the quotient is an algebra. The constructor now records both the language-determined formula algebra and its quotient type; an arbitrary propositional logic need not satisfy the displayed selfextensionality premise.</p>\n